{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周三（25日）大致多雲，早晚清涼及有一兩陣微雨，市區最低氣溫約17°C，新界再低一兩度。日間部分時間天色明朗，最高氣溫約21°C。吹和緩至清勁北至東北風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。周四（26日）早上仍然清涼。隨後一兩日漸轉天晴乾燥，氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:24:10.497663+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:58:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:52.154600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:17:26.272812+00:00","content_hash":"f286b70e0110b9e6b029c043fe214df56176256363ab6e7c62fd5eb483015d23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}